Package: dillo-vm
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: dillo
Description: virtual machine monitor that boots PMI files
 Dillo boots PMI images using KVM on Linux hosts. It supports virtio
 devices for guest storage, networking, consoles, and shared files.
 .
 The command is installed as /usr/bin/dillo. This package cannot be
 installed alongside the unrelated Dillo web browser.
